flowchart TD
 A[Pull request / commit] --> B[Unit + integration + AI eval]
 B -->|Fail| X[Block candidate]
 B --> C[Build one image and release bundle]
 C --> D[SBOM + scan + signature + provenance]
 D -->|Policy fail| X
 D --> E[Immutable release candidate]
 E --> F[Development gate]
 F --> G[Staging approval + compatibility]
 G --> H[Production approval]
 H --> I[5% canary]
 I --> J{SLO and quality healthy?}
 J -->|Yes| K[Expand traffic and promote]
 J -->|No| L[Restore previous known-good bundle]
 L --> M[Append rollback audit event]
